# Textures each scene loads beyond its level model's own, recorded on the
# console. dreamcast/build_pvr_textures.py puts a scene's level-model textures
# and these into the scene's bundle, which is read in one pass while the scene
# loads. A texture missing here still works: it is read on its own from the
# pack when the game asks for it, which can cause a short pause.
#
# Regenerate from a TEX_TRACE=1 log with dreamcast/record_scenes.py.
# Format: scene LEVEL ID ...   (IDs in hex, bit 15 set for 3D textures)
